      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Not a local JPA entity — every\nrow below only stores a numeric\ncompany_id (multi-tenant scoping),\nresolved against another service.\n\nReferenced by company_id in:\n  - campaign\n  - campaign_target\n  - contact\n  - call_attempt\n  - do_not_call_list\n  - audit_log\n  - scenario (nullable)",
